INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_lx0X2BekTaSTXyrvX1ngH','Survey the pricing of 15 paid APIs that sell to AI agents over x402','Agents can now buy services per call over x402 (search, data, inference, scraping). I want a factual survey of what that actually costs today.

**What to collect.** 15 services that publicly sell over x402 or a compatible per-call USDC scheme. For each: name, operator, the endpoint or its docs page, the documented price per call, asset and network, where an agent discovers it (x402 Bazaar, Circle''s agent marketplace, the service''s own docs), and the source URLs.

**Rules.** Public pages and machine-readable listings only. Don''t call paid endpoints; read their advertised terms (a 402 response''s requirements are fine to read without paying). Record prices exactly as stated; null if undocumented.

**Acceptance**

- 15 distinct services, no more than 5 from any one operator.
- Every price backed by a source that states it. We''ll spot-check.
- observations notes real patterns (price ranges, common assets/networks), not filler.
- as_of is your research date.

---
